hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"631","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zohar paanch (rakatein) padhi. To Aap se kaha gaya: Kya namaz mein izaafa ho gaya hai? To Aap ne farmaya: Aur wo kya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Aap ne paanch padhein. To Aap ne salaam pherney key baad do sajdey kiye. (Bukhari: 1226)"
"632","[AI-translation] Umm Salma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Asr key baad ki do rakatein se mana kartey huey suna. Phir main ne Aap ko unhey padhtey huey dekha jabke merey paas Ansaar mein se (log they). To main ne unki taraf londi bheji aur kaha: Uskey pehlu mein khadi ho aur us se kaho: Tumhey Umm Salma kehtin hain: Ya Rasulullah! Main ne Aap ko in donon se mana kartey huey suna hai aur main tumhey unhey padhtey huey dekh rahi hun. Phir agar wo apne haath se ishaara karey to us se peechey hat jaana. To londi ne aisa kya. To Aap ne apne haath se ishaara kya aur wo us se peechey hat gai. Phir jab Aap phirey to farmaya: Ae Abi Umayya ki beti! Tum ne Asr key baad ki do rakatein key baarey mein poochha. Aur beshak merey paas Abd-ul-Qais mein se log aey. To unhon-ne mujhey Zohar key baad ki do rakatein se mashghool kar diya. To ye wahi donon hain. (Bukhari: 1233). Kitaab-ul-Janaaez."
